    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented two-bedroom mid-terrace property ideally located in a quiet and convenient residential setting close to all local amenities. This bright and spacious home has been freshly painted throughout and is presented in excellent condition, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors, or those looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable living area, and a well-appointed kitchen/dining space. Upstairs features two generous double bedrooms along with a family bathroom. Recent upgrades include new laminate flooring and new carpets upstairs, adding a fresh modern feel throughout the home.\r\n\r\nAdditional benefits include gas fired central heating, communal parking, and a highly convenient location within walking distance of local shops, schools, and excellent public transport links. The property also enjoys easy access to the M1, M50, Dublin Airport, and is just minutes from the Pavilions Shopping Centre.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway (13'4'' x 5'11'') with new carpet, wired for alarm\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room (14'9'' x 7'0'') with wall and floor-mounted units, tiled between, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, oven, hob, extractor fan, breakfast bar, overlooking green, tiled floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room/Dining Room with new carpet, storage room off, feature fireplace with wooden surround, patio doors to rear garden\r\n\r\nStairs to first floor with new carpets, landing with hot press and shelving off, attic access off with pull down stira\r\n\r\nBedroom One (11'9'' x 12'9'') double bedroom, laminate flooring, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom (11'9'' x 12'9'') with wc, whb with vanity under, bath with mira shower, tiled surround, tiled floor\r\n\r\nBedroom Two (12'9'' x 8'7'') double bedroom, laminate flooring, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nRear Garden with fencing, planted areas, electric sockets, lawn"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas Fired Central Heating\r\nTwo Double Bedrooms\r\nFreshly painted throughout\r\nNew Laminate flooring upstairs\r\nNew Carpets upstairs\r\nCommunal Parking\r\nWalking distance to bus, schools and shops\r\nEasy access to M1/M50/Airport\r\nClose to Swords Pavilions Shopping Centre"
      },
